  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Missing Persons phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To safeguard and further advance the result of the past five years of the UK-supported regional cooperation process. The project aims to put in place steps to strengthen and sustain  the Missing Persons Group (MPG),  with active engagement of the families of missing persons.  The overall goal of the project is to ensure continued regional cooperation on the resolution of missing persons issue in the Western Balkans based on the rule of law principles.</narrative>
  </description>
